@baseUrl = http://localhost:5157

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get a token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Fire truck", "description": "Toy", "colour": "Red", "price": 49.99 }

### List all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List products by colour
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?colour=red
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
